    "answer": {
      "short": "83 cents per mango.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Cost per mango}&=\\$20\\div24\\\\\\text{Cost per mango}&=\\$\\frac{5}{6}\\\\\\text{Cost per mango}&\\approx\\$0.83\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore, each mango costs 83 cents, correct to the nearest cent.",
